  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.8.0: Ordered decorator stacking — Order property on [DecorateScoped/Singleton/Transient] controls which decorator is innermost vs outermost when multiple decorators target the same service type. All intermediate concrete types are self-registered for direct injection. 1.7.0: AW004 Warning diagnostic — captive dependency detection. 1.6.0: IncludeSelf = true. 1.5.0: [HostedService] + AW003. 1.4.0: Decorator support. 1.3.0: AllowMultiple, DuplicateStrategy, TryX, AW001+AW002. 1.2.0: Open generics + AutoWireOptions. 1.0.0: Initial release.",
